  "The stored RecoilDecreaseFactor, applied through the site's law, overstates recovery by about 20% on the AK-205; whether the constant is universal (the BF1 community formula carried an unexplained constant), per recovery profile, or a different time base needs a second weapon with a different profile."
 ],
